<sign sign="Ff301"><signDescription lang="en" sign="Ff301">+lSign for numbers in hieratic texts. Often, hieratic distinguishes between the ideogram marker+s-!
Z1-+land the unit digits, the later being much larger. If carelessly rendering the text in standardised hieroglyphs,+s-!
+lthis distinction is lost. Consider +s-h:r-W:ra-Z1-Z1\200-Z1\200-+l for hrw 2.+s</signDescription><hasTransliteration sign="Ff301" transliteration="1" type="abbreviation" use="keyboard"/></sign>
